{"title":"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/5/73584d7efe315984f74ba23714c3487f2a584427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5 - 2}{2 + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/b/fbbd4e5500ec9608b1bda46b55d7cd510ceeb3c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ -5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"395\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b074830f05d7d2ed47f4e110e1d02388e24c4600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5fee3d94e64737a0aaba0b7b2a23839198e44b53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 1 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />. Since these numbers are equal, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2cbe8bb96a1fd0515985e62f6396425f3de5d82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5 - 2}{2 + 1} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"126\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley\">2012 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Pr